# PHASE-0 requires no environment variables to run the default smoke-test page.
#
# Do not put secrets in this file. Local browser values belong in apps/web/.env.local;
# PHASE-05 test values belong in the ignored repository-root .env.phase05.test.
# Deployed values belong in the relevant Vercel/Supabase settings.
# Add a variable only in the phase that introduces the corresponding integration.
#
# Browser-only MAPID Light XYZ tiles. This key is intentionally browser-visible;
# use a dedicated, rotated/revoked, domain/referer-restricted RUJAK key where supported.
# Never commit a real key.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPID_MAPS_API_KEY=
#
# Browser-only integrations, deferred beyond PHASE-05:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#
# PHASE-05 server-side only. Do not use a public/anon URL for any value below.
# Runtime must use the exact Dashboard shared transaction-pooler host at :6543,
# database `postgres`, and the custom username `rujak_runtime.<project-ref>`.
# Its password must be distinct from the admin password. Never reconstruct the
# host; use the supplied Dashboard URL and change only the authentication identity.
# Admin URLs are for migrations/imports (Direct preferred; Session pooler fallback).
# DATABASE_URL_RUNTIME=
# DATABASE_URL_ADMIN=
# RUJAK_RUNTIME_DB_PASSWORD=
# RUJAK_ANALYSIS_VERSION=p0-central-v1
# RUJAK_POSTGIS_SCHEMA=
#
# AI provider credentials are deferred until Phase 7.
